{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12101170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12101170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1210117001:1":{"text":"Those are some high walls...! What is this place?","source_cn":"好高大的城墙……！这里是什么地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D78B505FAA3991","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210117002:0":{"text":"... You don't know?","source_cn":"……你们不知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBA523F11B90A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1210117002":{"text":"... You don't know?","source_cn":"……你们不知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBA523F11B90A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210117003:0":{"text":"This is <style=\"highlight\">Rustport</style>.","source_cn":"这地方是<style=highlight>锈锚港</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBECC82947ACCC3D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210117004:1":{"text":"I can't believe you came here without knowing anything about this place...","source_cn":"厉害啊，你们几个，什么都不知道就开着船闯过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCCEC13524A6F957","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210117005:0":{"text":"We were planning to go to Cedartown for the festivities, but when we were sailing there, a fog appeared. Then a huge tentacle came out of nowhere and upended our boat!","source_cn":"我们本来准备去雪松镇参加庆典，但是航行的时候，突然起了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BCCE7B81A574016","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210117006:0":{"text":"I get it now, but how can anyone sail through this <style=\"highlight\">fog</style>...?","source_cn":"到这里我就听懂了。这才对劲，怎么可能有人能穿过这<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9AA6CFCD6C673C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210117007:1":{"text":"That's what we did though. Anyway, do you think Chippy will be in the city?","source_cn":"满满，满满会在城里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392B6E11B1716113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210117008:0":{"text":"All we can do is look around. There are several docks we can check. Hopefully, <style=\"highlight\">Tritonus</style> took pity on him and had him wash up here.","source_cn":"找找才知道，城里有好几个码头。希望<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D013B53757FDD3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210117009:1":{"text":"Who is <style=\"highlight\">Tritonus</style>?","source_cn":"<style=highlight>特勒米琉斯</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA03905C000299B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210117010:1":{"text":"You don't know? Oh, right, you're outsiders.","source_cn":"你们不知道？也是，毕竟是外乡人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF98EB3B1703073C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210117011:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">Tritonus</style> is the god of the waves and wandering. A lot of us are seafaring folk, so many of us believe in him.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>特勒米琉斯</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A5C20DBBF0C8A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210117012:0":{"text":"I see. Well, I also hope he blessed Chippy and that he's safe somewhere...","source_cn":"原来是这样。希望满满能平安……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABB6D47A7783485F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"I don't know.","source_cn":"不知道","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD5580655A74225AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I don't know.","female":"I don't know.","variant_male_record_index":"65284","variant_female_record_index":"